[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に申し訳ないっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm so sorry!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "皆で協力して作り上げた台本を……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After all the work everyone put into that script..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……頭を上げてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You don't need to apologize."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元の台本とは違いましたけど……いえ、元の台本以上に\n素晴らしい演説だったと思いますよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It may have been different from the original script... but I think it was even more wonderful than the one we prepared!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほ、本当か……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "D-do you really think so...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000とても気持ちがこもっていて、\nついつい引き込まれてしまいました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! It was so heartfelt that I couldn't help but be drawn in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたしも！\u3000最初はひやひやしたけど、\n途中からそれも気にならなくなっちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too! I was worried at first, but I stopped thinking about that pretty quickly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "正直、ロマンの演説が終わった後、\nこれでは勝てないかもしれない、と思っていました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To be honest, after Roman's speech, I thought that we wouldn't stand a chance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ですが、あの内容ならば勝負になるかもしれません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But with what you said, there might be hope now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だといいが……彼の方が望まれているのなら、\n彼が生徒会長になるべきだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope so... though if he's what the students want, then he should be the one to become president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミ。私の演説はどうだっただろうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi. What did you think of my speech?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……やっぱり、私にはそこまで刺さりませんでした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It didn't quite resonate with me, to be honest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、なんというか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But how should I put this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたは前から引っ張るのではなく、\n後ろから押してくれるのでもなく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're not the type to lead from the front, nor the type to push from behind..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手を繋いで、隣にいてくれるのだろうなと\nそう感じました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I felt that you'd be the kind to take my hand and walk beside me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい演説だったと思います。\n当選、できるといいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was a good speech. I hope you win the election."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ああ、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいはい。みんなちゅうもーく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, everyone! Attention please!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出口調査の結果が出ました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have the exit poll results!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出口調査？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exit poll?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "所信表明演説が終わった後、教室に戻る生徒に\n直接アンケート取ってきたんだ。誰に投票するつもりか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We surveyed students heading back to their classrooms after the speeches. Asked who they're planning to vote for."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんなことしてたんですか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you were doing that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで……結果は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... the results?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ユナさんは支持率２位です。事前投票より\n差は詰まりましたが、まだロマンさんが優勢ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Juna is in second place. The gap has narrowed since the preliminary poll, but Roman is still in the lead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっかあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番の投票はこれからですから。\nまだ結果は分かりませんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The actual voting is still to come. We don't know the final results yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やれることはやりました。\nあとは結果を待ちましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've done what we can. Now we wait for the outcome."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。どんな結果でも受け入れる覚悟はできている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I'm prepared to accept whatever the result may be."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]